                                Variant: 17


                                   ABOUT
                                   =====

This repo is related to the web development class.


                               INSTALLATION
                               ============

1. Clone the repository:
    $ git clone https://github.com/gdcdec/weblab6

2. Jump to the 'weblab6' directory:
    $ cd weblab6/

3. Intall all dependencies specified in 'package.json':
    $ npm install


                                   USAGE
                                   =====

1. Lint the code:
    $ npm run lint:back

    or

    $ npm run lint:front

2. Check the code:
    $ npm run check:back

    or

    $ npm run check:front

    See another options in the 'package.json'.

3. Delete all dependencies:
    $ npm run clean
